# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch / generated output. Deliberately NOT blanket *.txt or *.md: the
# Windows build needs CMakeLists.txt, the fonts ship OFL.txt licences, and
# README.md / docs/ are real project docs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Analysis + debug dumps
analyze*.txt
analysis_output.txt
*_analysis.txt
diff.txt
scratch/

# Dumped tool output (Supabase project lists, generated API spec)
projects.json
all_projects.json
openapi.json

